      "general": {
        "abstract": "The site of Toulouse (code ICOS FR-Tou) is located in southwestern France, in the city of Toulouse, over an experimental field at the premises of Meteo-France. The vegetation consists of a grassland cut at least once a year. The city of Toulouse is located in the semi-oceanic climate",
